  "facts_of_case": "Pranab Dutta had two wives; Moupiya Choudhury is the second wife. Usharani Das filed an application for monthly maintenance under Section 125 CrPC and was granted. Pranab Dutta expired, and Usharani Das sought a succession certificate. Moupiya Choudhury contested this application. The trial court held that the second marriage is void ab initio and dismissed Moupiya's petition.",
